# Patterns to ignore when building a chart package.
#
# Note what is *not* here: files/ is packaged, because the watch presets under
# files/presets/ are read at render time by templates/rbac/watcher-presets.yaml.
# ci/ is likewise packaged; it is small, and shipping the values files a release
# was linted with makes them reproducible from the chart alone.
.DS_Store
.git/
.gitignore
*.swp
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
*~
.project
.idea/
.vscode/
